Interpretation
  No k=13 open cover or nonempty protection core appeared.
  The initial segment is boundary-only with the unit skeleton, as
  expected.  Once the mandatory 14-gate is inserted, the scanned
  candidates become positive-gap again rather than more dangerous.
  The next proof angle is a 14=2*7 CRT descent: after a speed divisible
  by 14 protects the unit layer, divide that protected channel by 14
  and show the remaining endpoint peel cannot maintain a core.
